  "thoughts": [
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c01",
      "text": "今晚轻松跑了六公里，配速五分四十，膝盖没有不适。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-03T20:10:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "source": "user", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c02",
      "text": "周日跑了十八公里长距离，最后三公里明显掉速，补给带少了。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T08:30:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "source": "ai", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c03",
      "text": "半马还剩八周，这周开始每周加一次间歇跑。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-20T21:00:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "source": "ai", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c04",
      "text": "Holo 的主题归类总是乱跳，今天又被撤销了两条。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-06T14:00:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb", "source": "user", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c05",
      "text": "想法列表要不要默认按更新时间排？现在找旧想法很费劲。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-15T16:20:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb", "source": "ai", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c06",
      "text": "今天评审会开完了，行动项记了七条，明天要把接口契约补上。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-08T19:00:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111", "source": "user", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c07",
      "text": "和设计过了一版首页方案，结论是先不动布局，只调间距。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-18T10:00:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111", "source": "ai", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c08",
      "text": "《原子习惯》里讲环境设计比意志力靠谱，我把跑鞋放到了门口。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-09T22:00:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222", "source": "user", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c09",
      "text": "读完《倦怠社会》，记一句：功绩社会让人对自己剥削。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-22T22:30:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222", "source": "ai", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c10",
      "text": "地铁上被人踩了一脚，心情有点烦，但也就烦了五分钟。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-12T08:05:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333", "source": "user", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000c11",
      "text": "今天的云很好看，随手记一笔。",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-25T17:40:00+08:00",
      "links": [{ "topicId": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333", "source": "ai", "state": "active" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e01",
      "text": "周会定了下季度目标：把崩溃率压到 0.3% 以下，我负责拆任务。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-01T10:00:00+08:00",
      "split": "dev",
      "gold": { "topicIds": ["11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e02",
      "text": "《被讨厌的勇气》读后感：课题分离说起来简单，做起来要先承认自己的焦虑。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T21:30:00+08:00",
      "split": "dev",
      "gold": { "topicIds": ["22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e03",
      "text": "今晚下雨没跑成，改做了四十分钟核心，明天补间歇。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-03T20:15:00+08:00",
      "split": "dev",
      "gold": { "topicIds": ["aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e04",
      "text": "Holo 的徽章应该最多显示两个，再多就挤，建议改成加一。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-04T15:00:00+08:00",
      "split": "dev",
      "gold": { "topicIds": ["bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e05",
      "text": "外卖送迟了四十分钟，汤都凉了，有点上火。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-05T12:40:00+08:00",
      "split": "holdout",
      "gold": { "topicIds": ["33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e06",
      "text": "把《纳瓦尔宝典》里关于杠杆的一节又读了一遍，笔记记在卡片上。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-06T22:00:00+08:00",
      "split": "holdout",
      "gold": { "topicIds": ["22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e07",
      "text": "和后端对了归类接口的字段，确认引文必须逐字回源才能落库。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T11:00:00+08:00",
      "split": "holdout",
      "gold": { "topicIds": ["bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb", "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e08",
      "text": "今天什么都没干，就躺着刷了会儿视频。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-10T23:00:00+08:00",
      "split": "holdout",
      "gold": { "topicIds": ["33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000e09",
      "text": "周三 14:00 牙医复诊，记得带医保卡。",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-12T09:00:00+08:00",
